Background job (every 5 min + startup):
  1. WHERE vpn_peers.is_active = TRUE
     AND NOT EXISTS (
       SELECT 1 FROM entitlements e
       WHERE e.expires_at > NOW() + 10min grace
         AND owner ကိုက်ညီ (user XOR install)
     )
  2. foreach expired peer:
     a. wgctrl RemovePeer
     b. UPDATE vpn_peers SET is_active = FALSE
  3. Cleanup:
     - Revoked/expired refresh_tokens (>7d old)
     - Used/expired email_tokens (>1d old)
     - Stale anonymous_installs (30d inactive, no active entitlement)